  "thaiPrivacyInputTitle": "Data used for the chart",
  "thaiPrivacyInputBody": "When you search for a birthplace, FATE receives your search terms and selected area to find cities. To calculate the chart, the app sends your birth date, known birth time, city, city coordinates, and time zone to FATE over HTTPS. If the time is unknown, we calculate at 12:00 local time at the birthplace. Coordinates come from the city you select.",
  "thaiPrivacyStorageTitle": "Storage and recipients",
  "thaiPrivacyStorageBody": "The app keeps your guest birth details on your device until you change or clear them. FATE uses hosted servers to process the chart request and return the result. System backups follow your device settings.",
  "thaiPrivacyLogsTitle": "Service logs",
  "thaiPrivacyLogsBody": "Servers may log IP addresses, request times, paths, place search parameters, and response status to operate the service, limit unusual requests, and diagnose problems. Access logs rotate by file size.",
  "thaiPrivacyRightsTitle": "Privacy choices and contact",
  "thaiPrivacyRightsBody": "You can edit or clear your birth details on this device. Contact FATE through Help & support to request access, correction, deletion, or help with another privacy concern. We use the email address, message, and attachments you choose to provide to handle the request.",
  "thaiPrivacyContact": "Contact privacy support",
  "thaiHelpIntro": "Find help with charts, birthplace selection, and saved details, or contact FATE.",
  "supportFaqHeading": "Frequently asked questions",
  "thaiHelpChartQuestion": "How do I generate a Thai birth chart?",
  "thaiHelpChartAnswer": "On Home, enter your Gregorian birth date, birth time, and birth city. If you do not know your birth time, select that option. Choose Save and view my chart to open your chart and placements.",
  "thaiHelpTimeQuestion": "What if I do not know my exact birth time?",
  "thaiHelpCityQuestion": "How do I select a birth city?",
  "thaiHelpCityAnswer": "Select a country or region first. Where a province field appears, choose it before searching for a city. Try the local or English name and choose a city from the results so the app can match its time zone and coordinates.",
  "thaiHelpRetryQuestion": "What should I do if a chart fails to load?",
  "thaiHelpRetryAnswer": "Check your internet connection and tap Retry on the result page. If the problem continues, check the date, time, and city in Edit birth details and send support the steps and error message.",
  "thaiHelpDataQuestion": "How do I edit or clear my birth details?",
  "thaiHelpDataAnswer": "Choose Edit birth details on your chart and save to recalculate. In Me → Privacy & permissions, you can confirm and clear the birth details stored on this device.",
  "thaiHelpContactBody": "Include your device model, system version, the steps you took, and the error message. You can cover birth details and other personal information in screenshots.",
