  "termsBody": "FATE offers AI companionship and astrology for reflection and entertainment. Readings are not guaranteed predictions or medical, financial or legal advice. Guardians are fictional AI characters. Paid content is available only after verified payment; price and availability come from the store. Do not use FATE to harass others or submit unlawful content.",
